WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.695
- Dear D, just why is it that all

00:00:02.695 --> 00:00:04.502
these entries are about guys?

00:00:04.502 --> 00:00:05.758
I mean, what's the big deal?

00:00:05.758 --> 00:00:08.675
I think my 11 year old
self knew I was gay.

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:09.649
(laughs)

00:00:09.649 --> 00:00:12.316
(sign swinging)

00:00:14.072 --> 00:00:16.099
- I fell under the nerd category.

00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:18.059
I still fit in that category,

00:00:18.059 --> 00:00:19.280
but I've learned to embrace it.

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:22.256
- I was boy crazy. I was so boy crazy.

00:00:22.256 --> 00:00:23.713
Not much has changed.

00:00:23.713 --> 00:00:26.151
- I was heavily involved
with theater and chorus.

00:00:26.151 --> 00:00:27.825
I was very over achieving

00:00:27.825 --> 00:00:30.227
when it came to the performing arts.

00:00:30.227 --> 00:00:31.978
- That's all I cared about,

00:00:31.978 --> 00:00:33.972
is trying to be cool to my older cousins.

00:00:33.972 --> 00:00:36.233
- I was kind of a loser, a nerd,

00:00:36.233 --> 00:00:39.286
I had a few friends, but
then I was also very weird.

00:00:39.286 --> 00:00:41.195
I was weird before weird was like a thing

00:00:41.195 --> 00:00:43.157
people like to do to brand themselves.

00:00:43.157 --> 00:00:46.462
( staccato beats)

00:00:46.462 --> 00:00:47.582
- Oh man.

00:00:47.582 --> 00:00:50.842
- This summer, I met
the cutest Swedish boy.

00:00:50.842 --> 00:00:52.379
We played soccer together.

00:00:52.379 --> 00:00:54.512
Walked in the rain together.

00:00:54.512 --> 00:00:57.111
- Dear Diary, forget about Andy and Nick.

00:00:57.111 --> 00:00:59.611
How about Benj? He is so fine.

00:01:00.942 --> 00:01:02.554
- How is it that Swedish boys,

00:01:02.554 --> 00:01:06.784
are so much hotter than
gross American boys? (laughs)

00:01:06.784 --> 00:01:07.919
- Benj is so hot.

00:01:07.919 --> 00:01:10.365
He's Korean and Norwegian,
with blond tips.

00:01:10.365 --> 00:01:13.777
- I hate my non existent
dating life so much.

00:01:13.777 --> 00:01:17.307
Why won't Claire talk to me? Like why?

00:01:17.307 --> 00:01:20.353
I basically did her whole
entire lab report for her.

00:01:20.353 --> 00:01:22.363
C'mon Claire that's so savage of you.

00:01:22.363 --> 00:01:23.879
- I really want a lead in the Wizard of Oz

00:01:23.879 --> 00:01:25.140
but there's just two things in my way.

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:29.057
Brats. N and S. S is such
a brat and she sucks.

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:32.280
I pray to god she doesn't get Dorothy.

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:34.988
I want Wicked Witch of
the West, Cowardly Lion,

00:01:34.988 --> 00:01:36.493
Scarecrow or Tin Man.

00:01:36.493 --> 00:01:39.192
Guess what? I got cast as Dorothy.

00:01:39.192 --> 00:01:40.335
- July 18, 2001

00:01:40.335 --> 00:01:42.670
Today I thought I'd tell you about Zack.

00:01:42.670 --> 00:01:45.589
Two words M. H. Major Hottie.

00:01:45.589 --> 00:01:47.318
- This girl I have no interest in

00:01:47.318 --> 00:01:49.796
asked to be my date to
the 8th grade formal.

00:01:49.796 --> 00:01:52.261
But all I want to do is take Claire.

00:01:52.261 --> 00:01:54.315
I've never felt this
way about anyone before.

00:01:54.315 --> 00:01:56.446
I'm totally in loves with her.

00:01:56.446 --> 00:01:57.858
Does she loves me?

00:01:57.858 --> 00:01:58.691
I don't know.

00:01:58.691 --> 00:02:00.429
I don't know why I thought
a plural was a good idea,

00:02:00.429 --> 00:02:02.300
I was like 13, 14 by this time.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:04.074
- March 22, 1988

00:02:04.074 --> 00:02:05.086
You'll never believe this.

00:02:05.086 --> 00:02:07.139
All of the popular kids
running for class president

00:02:07.139 --> 00:02:09.297
got beaten by Andy Rebold.

00:02:09.297 --> 00:02:11.155
This was huge because Andy,

00:02:11.155 --> 00:02:12.808
he wore bright orange shoes,

00:02:12.808 --> 00:02:14.449
and his motto was,

00:02:14.449 --> 00:02:17.226
"Vote for the schmoe
with the shoes that glow"

00:02:17.226 --> 00:02:20.578
And he won and it was a great
victory for nerds everywhere.

00:02:20.578 --> 00:02:22.412
Thank you Andy, thank you.

00:02:22.412 --> 00:02:25.824
- And did I mention that
he's from London, England?

00:02:25.824 --> 00:02:29.272
Yeah, his accent makes
him ten times hotter

00:02:29.272 --> 00:02:30.633
than he already is.

00:02:30.633 --> 00:02:32.881
- I had my first sip of beer today,

00:02:32.881 --> 00:02:35.516
it tasted like absolute ass.

00:02:35.516 --> 00:02:36.947
- The dance was so fun,

00:02:36.947 --> 00:02:38.104
the whole time we were dancing

00:02:38.104 --> 00:02:40.775
we were staring into each other's eyes.

00:02:40.775 --> 00:02:41.964
(gagging)

00:02:41.964 --> 00:02:43.535
(laughing)

00:02:43.535 --> 00:02:45.286
- I hate this, I hate beer.

00:02:45.286 --> 00:02:47.225
I hate girls, I hate Christmas.

00:02:47.225 --> 00:02:49.943
Only Radiohead gets me.

00:02:49.943 --> 00:02:53.490
- I think it's so funny to have a diary.

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:54.763
And cathartic.

00:02:54.763 --> 00:02:55.821
You know even when I was 11

00:02:55.821 --> 00:02:57.575
this was really important for me to write.

00:02:57.575 --> 00:02:59.601
- Yeah, I'm never going
to stop keeping diaries.

00:02:59.601 --> 00:03:01.837
And I'm so happy that I have these.

00:03:01.837 --> 00:03:04.177
No matter how freaking
embarrassing they are.

00:03:04.177 --> 00:03:05.536
- I would tell myself the things

00:03:05.536 --> 00:03:07.953
that make you seem weird now,

00:03:08.864 --> 00:03:11.137
will continue to make you seem weird.

00:03:11.137 --> 00:03:13.490
But as you get older that's kind of cool.

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:16.369
- ♫ The rest is still unwritten. ♫

00:03:16.369 --> 00:03:18.320
- I'm under so much
stress of who I'm taking

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:19.509
to 8th grade formal.

00:03:19.509 --> 00:03:22.754
I feel like I'm the President
of all of the states.

00:03:22.754 --> 00:03:25.791
I mean 8th grade formal is
bigger than senior prom.

00:03:25.791 --> 00:03:27.505
Time to get inspo from Radiohead.

00:03:27.505 --> 00:03:29.835
( sign swinging )

